{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-10_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-10",
  "title": "長夜終盡",
  "storyCode": "5-10",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-10_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "baf973a7beb5826785ac304d83add0b74f1f2a680bc519cfe38f03446785e702",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "退路已盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......你，你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你們還想往哪逃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "放下你的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你的把戲已經被我看穿了，長鱗的小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我說了，我看穿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "煌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哼，不算什麼，這點火力也就和鞭炮差不多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你提前防禦住了弩彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你知道他們的位置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "那當然，我已經全都找出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "阿米婭，後退，我該用那個了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "知道！我會再一次干擾梅菲斯特的護衛，抓緊時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "這點血是送你們做臨別禮物的，整合運動的“幻影弩手”們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沸騰吧，爆開他們的偽裝吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你潑灑自己的血，用血來點火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哈，我難道看起來像個術師嗎？那種四處縱火的傢伙，最多只是些自我意識過剩的門外漢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "抱歉，這是戰鬥技巧。現身吧射手們，你們無處可藏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "浮士德，偽裝消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "命令，撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "那些是......怎麼回事！整合運動的狙擊手是什麼時候埋伏在那裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "數個整合運動的狙擊手突然現身，主要分佈在近衛局東二樓和南三樓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "留神腳下，低處可能也有埋伏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "大樓裡的古怪之處，也是他們引起的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "透過空氣折射讓身形變得透明啊，好手法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "不過你掩蓋不了自己的行蹤，又或者是動作幅度太大，也會導致這個源石技藝失效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我說得對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......你很聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "是羅德島情報做得好。你沒戲唱了，投降吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "如果還要打的話，哼，不管有沒有你的份，你都得為Ace和Scout抵命，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "浮士德，我們還有彈藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "撤退。我們已經失去了情報優勢。我會狙擊他們，你們立刻轉移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "為什麼不射擊她？浮士德！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "我的護衛們，快去！四個人，四個人而已......其中只有三個能和你們為敵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "戰鬥！現在就撕碎這些罪人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我們三個在Dr.{@nickname}的指揮下，勝過你們所有人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "更何況那些被你傷害了、剝奪了理智的感染者，意識裡只剩下你的贅餘思緒，不再是活生生的人......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "就連你身邊那個帶鱗的男孩也未必和你同心，他的思緒裡充斥著混亂和悲傷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "梅菲斯特，你才是這戰場上孤身一人的那個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "你讀了我的心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我只是感受到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "所以你不會知道我在想什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "阿米婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我沒事，他的弩彈我勉強擋的下來......！但這樣的話，那些護衛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "【雜亂的發音】"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我的控制力在變弱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特，走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "他們的援軍正在消滅我們的隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "有些部隊我們從沒見過。計畫有變，我們被算計了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......為什麼整合運動，二十多支小隊，兩支大隊，還沒在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "弑君者為什麼還沒在這裡？霜星為什麼不在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "這次和切爾諾伯格不同。我們沒有切斷對方的通訊，敵人有大量援軍，抵抗很激烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "梅菲斯特......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "為什麼他們還沒在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "想知道原因，我們要親眼去看。先離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "煌，我差不多到極限了，你們能行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒問題，我和那個姓陳的，應該夠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我允許你走了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你......護衛們！去殺了她！殺了她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咯......咯！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嘁，十幾個一起動，難辦了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "【咆哮】！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "他們要上了，姓陳的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "謝謝你，羅德島的幹員。現在沒人干擾我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "（咳，還是不行？我甚至沒法讓它徹底接觸空氣......算了，做到這步，應該夠了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "（赤霄，至少這時候......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "“其色溢赤——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......咕啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......不是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，唔......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特的護衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（烏薩斯語）謝......謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你剛才是不是拔劍了？一劍？十幾個這種東西？全滅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那把劍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "阿米婭，有些話我是不是不能再亂說了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "你......你做了......什......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你也逃不掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "咕......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "浮士德，浮士德！你受傷了，你，不，不......不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "咳咳，居然引誘我近身後再射擊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你這不是擋住了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "他們要借著爆炸逃走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "嗚啊，連環爆炸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哎，整個頂樓都塌陷了，感覺我們追不了了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "一半是你剛才劃開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "那也沒辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "現在，快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "不行，我要在這裡，等到他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "這一步失敗了。你必須走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "失敗，失敗？不可能！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "難道一切不都是謀劃好了嗎......我不是早就召集整合運動了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "背叛？洩密？究竟是誰？近衛局為什麼會知道我們的分佈和計畫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "如果不是叛徒，又究竟是誰做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "塔露拉姐姐是不會犯錯的，所以她是故意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "不會，不會的，她為什麼要故意這樣設計？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......浮士德，我不想承認這是我們的失敗。我不相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "text": "跳！我會拉住你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "唉喲，這慘狀，你要好好修修這棟樓了，長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "遺憾，還是被那兩個小子逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "剩下那些沒腦子的傢伙像受驚的獸群一樣湧過來，想全部制服，還真有點難度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "至少我們成功地奪回了近衛局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "哪怕是暫時的，這也是我們的勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "阿米婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "羅德島是怎麼撤出切城的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是這位羅德島幹員，煌小姐，及時支援了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "也有一位說話音量很大的龍門警官在廢城外接應......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "如果最開始近衛局沒有袖手旁觀的話，過程還會更順利些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我還在想你是不是會說些沒有羅德島的幫助你也可以，你寧可和他們同歸於盡一類的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "還行，看來你還沒迂腐到那種程度。還有什麼想說的？沒有的話，我想回羅德島了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "羅德島竟然還有那樣的飛行載具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哎，羅德島還有很多會讓你驚訝的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們和羅德島一樣，不想把手牌打光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "羅德島難不成也算是你的牌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "陳，陳長官......獨立線路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "是通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "陳警官，你做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "詩懷雅警官在頻道中嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "請向我彙報現在的進度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "羅德島也救出來了，各大隊我也安排好了。調度加指揮，花了我整整三個晚上欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那麼，陳警官呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我已經奪回——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——在羅德島的協助下，我已經奪回近衛局。這個消息將借整合運動的指揮官之口，傳達給所有整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "龍門中潛藏的所有整合運動，已經聚集在這個城區，也照我們封堵和架設的所有路線，進入了各個埋伏點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "接下來，只需等待他們的反撲即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我的任務已經完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們的其他幾位同事也已經向我遞交了報告，上個階段的任務，大家都圓滿地完成了。各位做得很不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那麼，我們該進入下個階段了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
